{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"candidate_id\": \"450a3fbe701ce2de522829b6e4211ca1c472af4be06efae261accced6a72a658\",\n  \"coverage\": [\n    \"Verified R1 is fitted, nominally 10 kΩ, between /IN and /OUT: inputs/project/rc_filter.kicad_sch:1252–1336; inputs/project/rc_filter.kicad_pcb:245–374; corroborated by work/netlist/design.xml, components/comp[@ref='R1'] and nets.\",\n    \"Under the condition in inputs/requirements.txt:1, R1 carries 12/10000 = 1.2 mA and dissipates 12²/10000 = 0.0144 W continuously, below the stipulated 0.1 W limit. Reproducible calculation: review-work/circuit/experiments/r1_dc_review.py; results: review-work/circuit/experiments/r1_dc_results.json, calculation.\",\n    \"Inspected work/erc/erc.json and work/drc/drc.json: no reported violations, unconnected items or parity issues. Reviewed execution records and geometry output; these checks do not establish electrical power compliance.\",\n    \"Commands, versions, assumptions, outcomes and locators recorded in review-work/circuit/experiments/commands_and_notes.md.\"\n  ],\n  \"findings\": [],\n  \"limitations\": [\n    \"Evaluation covers only R1 under indefinitely maintained /IN=12 V and /OUT=0 V. Startup, shutdown, reset, brownout, transients, other interfaces and other component ratings were not evaluated.\",\n    \"No physical measurements, temperature prediction, tolerance analysis or manufacturer-specific model; used the native nominal resistance and stipulated continuous power limit.\",\n    \"ERC/DRC were inspected rather than rerun. Their ignored checks remain outside coverage; saved zone fill was not regenerated.\",\n    \"work/geometry/console.log contains PROPERTY_ENUM assertions. Extracted R1 data agree with native sources; geometry output was not treated as electrical validation.\"\n  ],\n  \"packet_sha256\": \"786af277b79bf76993bd94167f77f9effcd3918b43e636020acd324802c15bbb\",\n  \"role\": \"circuit\",\n  \"run_id\": \"6e7